README
AuditLedger
Enterprise-grade Audit Logging Platform for Modern Applications.
AuditLedger captures every database change with complete user context and provides tamper-resistant audit trails required for SOC2, HIPAA, ISO27001, GDPR, and enterprise governance.
Problem
Modern applications need to answer:
•Who changed the data?
•What was changed?
•When was it changed?
•From where was it changed?
•What was the previous value?
•What is the current value?
Most companies build this repeatedly.
AuditLedger provides this capability out of the box.
